{
  "id": "E417",
  "title": "Do Hens Rest?",
  "level": "newbie",
  "date": "2020-04-02",
  "synopsis": "Little Ming is surprising his teacher again. How?",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/50417/d0e8e0851202ef15b9be8c9f98963f365a036833.mp3?1585482497",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "鸡会休息吗?\n\n老师：有个人有五个鸡，每天每个鸡会生一个鸡蛋，请问他每天能有几个鸡蛋？\n小明：老师，我知道。五个！\n老师：非常好。那他一个星期能有几个鸡蛋？\n小明：老师，他的鸡星期天休息吗？\n",
    "traditional": "雞會休息嗎?\n\n老師：有個人有五個雞，每天每個雞會生一個雞蛋，請問他每天能有幾個雞蛋？\n小明：老師，我知道。五個！\n老師：非常好。那他一個星期能有幾個雞蛋？\n小明：老師，他的雞星期天休息嗎？\n"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Do hens rest?"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "老师：有个人有五个鸡，每天每个鸡会生一个鸡蛋，",
      "traditional": "老師：有個人有五個雞，每天每個雞會生一個雞蛋，",
      "pinyin": "lǎo shī yǒu ge rén yǒu wǔ ge jī měi tiān měi ge jī huì shēng yí ge jī dàn",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "请问他每天能有几个鸡蛋？",
      "traditional": "請問他每天能有幾個雞蛋？",
      "pinyin": "qǐng wèn tā měi tiān néng yǒu jǐ ge jī dàn",
      "english": "Teacher: A man has five hens. Each hen can lay one egg every day."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "May I ask how many eggs can he have per day?"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "小明：老师，我知道。五个！",
      "traditional": "小明：老師，我知道。五個！",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo míng lǎo shī wǒ zhī dào wǔ ge",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Ming: Teacher, I know. Five!"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "老师：非常好。那他一个星期能有几个鸡蛋？",
      "traditional": "老師：非常好。那他一個星期能有幾個雞蛋？",
      "pinyin": "lǎo shī fēi cháng hǎo nà tā yí ge xīng qī néng yǒu jǐ ge jī dàn",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Teacher: Very good. Then how many eggs can he have in one week?"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "小明：老师，他的鸡星期天休息吗？",
      "traditional": "小明：老師，他的雞星期天休息嗎？",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo míng lǎo shī tā de jī xīng qī tiān xiū xi ma",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Ming: Teacher, do his hens rest on Sundays?"
    }
  ],
